### 1. Print author
GET http://localhost:8080/topic/api/printAuthor

### 2. Insert a record
POST http://localhost:8080/topic/api/postNewTopic
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectId": 1, "title": "Cause and Effect", "lessonContent": "A cause is why something happens. An effect is what happens as a result." }

### 3. Search all records
GET http://localhost:8080/topic/api/getAllTopics

### 4. Update a record
PUT http://localhost:8080/topic/api/putTopic?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectId": 1, "title": "Signal Words", "lessonContent": "Words like because, so, and as a result connect a cause to its effect." }

### 5. Delete a record
DELETE http://localhost:8080/topic/api/deleteTopic/1